## Required Python Packages and Their Purpose

numpy  
Used for numerical operations, arrays, and mathematical computations.

pandas  
Handles data loading, cleaning, and manipulation of the credit card dataset.

matplotlib  
Creates visualizations such as confusion matrices and ROC curves.

seaborn  
Enhances visualizations with cleaner, more attractive statistical plots.

scikit-learn  
Provides tools for preprocessing, splitting data, training models, and evaluating performance (accuracy, recall, F1‑score, ROC‑AUC).

xgboost  
Implements the XGBoost classifier, which often delivers the best performance for fraud detection.

imbalanced-learn  
Supplies SMOTE and other techniques to handle the severe class imbalance in fraud datasets.
